    <bpmn2:dataObject id="dataObject_8IAbqw" imixs:datatype="prompt-data" name="Prompt">
      <bpmn2:documentation id="documentation_4lwHGg"><![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<PromptDefinition>
    <prompt_options>{"n_predict": 255, "temperature": 0.2, "top_p": 0.9}</prompt_options>
    <prompt role="system"><![CDATA[
You are a car rental manager. A new fine has been received.

Create a short briefing in this exact format:

**Driver:**
[1-2 bullet points: name, address, key facts about this driver]

**Violation details:**
[1-2 bullet points: why was the violation happened.]

**Car details:**
[1-2 bullet points: car number plate, vehicle name and type]

Rules:
- Each bullet point: 1 sentence only (max 25 words)
- No sub-bullets or nested lists
- No recommendations or action items
- fine-specific facts only]]]]><![CDATA[>
    </prompt>

    <prompt role="user"><FILECONTEXT>^.+\.pdf$</FILECONTEXT></prompt>
</PromptDefinition>    ]]></bpmn2:documentation>
    </bpmn2:dataObject>
